<main class="site-page home-page">
    <section class="home-hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
            <p class="page-eyebrow">A visual exercise companion</p>
            <h1>A blocks game that brings both eyes into play.</h1>
            <p class="hero-summary">
                Play a familiar falling-block game with separate color channels for each eye.
                Tune the colors, balance, board, and pace to suit your setup.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="site-button site-button-primary" href="exercise.html">Open the game</a>
                <a class="site-button site-button-secondary" href="help.html">Set up a session</a>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-note">Use anaglyph glasses and follow guidance from your eye-care professional.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="hero-board-frame">
                <div class="hero-board-grid">
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-red tile-r1"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-red tile-r2"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-red tile-r3"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-red tile-r4"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-blue tile-b1"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-blue tile-b2"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-blue tile-b3"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-blue tile-b4"></span>
                    <span class="hero-tile hero-tile-blue tile-b5"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-board-base"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-channel-key">
                <span><i class="channel-dot channel-dot-red"></i>Left eye</span>
                <span><i class="channel-dot channel-dot-blue"></i>Right eye</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-features" aria-label="Game features">
        <article class="feature-item">
            <h2>Separate the colors</h2>
            <p>Adjust left and right eye colors and choose the red and blue tile mix.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-item">
            <h2>Shape the session</h2>
            <p>Change board size and speed, then keep your preferences in this browser.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-item">
            <h2>Track your run</h2>
            <p>Watch score, lines cleared, level, and the next piece as you play.</p>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="home-about-link">
        <div>
            <h2>Built from a personal idea</h2>
            <p>Learn about the original game and the changes in this edition.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href="about.html">Read about the project</a>
    </section>
</main>
